{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/tlxrf031suxmjff8rju8xxqhtmyua8n.mp3","text":"这里......有危险的气味。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/tdid5pawend6zkw1jgonkcciej0y3gi.mp3","text":"红要单独行动。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/71/fn2p76yaj9t1c55r2w1tpn1n6bcnlde.mp3","text":"名字，报酬，杀掉。很简单。凯尔希与红是这么约定的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/95/0pewzqg8a88ur1nxvpbf7um7qouq3xc.mp3","text":"狼有牙齿，红有刀。狼不会休息，所以红也不能。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/e38sr1juvemrzarnrurv1l9052ugce8.mp3","text":"“外婆”在呼唤......红能听见。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/9qm67r060zb0nhgcc03ko80b5u043oj.mp3","text":"......荒野的风，尘土里的残骸，群星下的嚎叫......红闻到了。那是狼的气味。红，加入狩猎。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/nyhnitaa82gyjnne88stps6azlbq4jv.mp3","text":"家人？红没有家人。红一开始就是孤身一人。博士是......需要家人吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/18/6vjb9k1s8vryyzd5xgmd2tpinvxnys1.mp3","text":"她们都躲着红。红其实只是想......摸摸她们的尾巴。普罗旺斯的，德克萨斯的......红在她们身上，能闻到红喜欢的味道。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/jtygaq3pbyrqjwxfd9a7lx939r5abi1.mp3","text":"博士，红也想过......如果红不是猎狼人，会不会也能有不一样的生活？这个问题要红......自己回答？唔。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/kcgy38a2qdrfmywscv5x1f2tmpc2flg.mp3","text":"博士。不，只是觉得你睡着了。现在，还不能睡。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/idtf81pnfm6hppmzd00dciyrodnooy7.mp3","text":"猎狼人，红，闻到了狼的气息。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/j6djp7g7pntldiiqr6fp8p8g3x20zgl.mp3","text":"只要对狩猎有利。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/7pxqbxe98fb42br12yshwz9zx923xz1.mp3","text":"无所谓。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/od9bsx1293bdhnhbkg5t2nxcfaf9tf4.mp3","text":"伪装？荣誉可以伪装自己，红能接受。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/1ocne88l4tpv8am8t98u19w9dl8udrb.mp3","text":"成功混进来了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/152yws8ap2hr1l5qa8rlgj82qq7lgmc.mp3","text":"红该做什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/oo2n66u2yqlrvlrwo6g9jnp9v0pj5c3.mp3","text":"狩猎，开始。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/o8zenqgyxh0vw8s0y0s6ddq68eb8n14.mp3","text":"气味，很浓烈。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/grjawoy08v76cwt125fa1h5exjpkcrk.mp3","text":"快。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/1ilng3kgxc6vslo9kx0righzlp00cp4.mp3","text":"简单明了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/l6bt1l6gi6rz8b5bl39ao9l1q26z1jj.mp3","text":"速度。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/64vy41jmtmeb8hcqmlr7j2ovv8cvcea.mp3","text":"技巧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/spxc5lrq5xdv1hxsg99yuhcv6tu8j5d.mp3","text":"从阴影中......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/e0n5ppbti2o4py11139jctfh48a14ok.mp3","text":"搅乱他们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/be1tmvjqi5n46sanl0c8posb7jwbb4x.mp3","text":"你无路可退。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/ajpquuhtkw2z7m8yrx0arvj1jddujjk.mp3","text":"红的眼中——倒映出你的死。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/25311i1k569lb6tl8pia7k0hi0ul52u.mp3","text":"全灭。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/qx30o2kdgzf0iymn2fb6dfa0jlob5bv.mp3","text":"猎物的下场，只有一种。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/8hq7flhxuf8ie6e76lyggub7m029jy4.mp3","text":"收获......不够丰富。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/bhokjb9579h11po3vy7w7qpd3sbhrya.mp3","text":"......红的刀......还不够锋利......","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_red/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/keeutmn0c89iq3bw2yt5j2n64s4ns31.mp3","text":"红，不太习惯室内，不过，也不讨厌。","alt":"voice_cn/char_144_